      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow (Location variation):\nGetEmployeeAuthorization (1) \u2192 GetLocation (10)\n\u2192 SkidDataComplete (6)\n\nControl: Location (UserControl, 367\u00d7268, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout:\n\u2022 label1: \"Location\" at y=9\n\u2022 label2: \"Enter in the location to be printed on the label.\" at y=47\n\u2022 tbLocation: 271\u00d720 at (3,63) \u2014 main input\n\nPrinceton-only variation. Prints a location label.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow (Location variation):\nGetEmployeeAuthorization (1) \u2192 GetLocation (10)\n\u2192 SkidDataComplete (6)\n\nControl: Location (UserControl, 367\u00d7268, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout:\n\u2022 label1: \"Location\" at y=9\n\u2022 label2: \"Enter in the location to be printed on the label.\" at y=47\n\u2022 tbLocation: 271\u00d720 at (3,63) \u2014 main input\n\nPrinceton-only variation. Prints a location label.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
